= Siegfried Aufhäuser

Aufhäuser is [? if chancellor = "Aufhäuser": the current Chancellor and ?] [? if president = "Aufhäuser": the current President and ?] a leader of the AfA-Bund, the federation of socialist white-collar trade unions.

- @white_collar
- @union_unity
